<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>iamatomicccc</Major>
    <Description>(screen resolution 1024 x 768 windowed mode )

auto throw the med kit when life is low just activate the macro and then it will automatically throw a med kit when your life is low. no dpi no sensitivity needed for this macro set up guys.

Only activate this macro if you are not in an intense gunfght because i believe it will affect how you shoot when suddenly your life falls short</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>GoColor 3 2 210,187,70 210,149,70 2 1000 400 300 430 1 0
Goto 1
KeyDown 34 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 34 1
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 10 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 10 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Point blank</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>